{
 "note": "Arabic for the series CBE never named in Arabic. CBE publishes title_ar for the Excel archive and for nothing else, which leaves 223 series unnamed -- every FX rate, every policy rate, every treasury bill, all of inflation, which is to say everything on the front page. These are ours, not the Bank's, and build_exports.py marks them title_ar_source: miqyas so the site can say so.",
 "how": "CBE's English titles are '<table> - <line>', so the Arabic is composed the same way rather than written out 223 times. ingest/build_titles_ar.py joins them and lists anything it cannot compose, so a new series from CBE shows up as a gap rather than silently staying English.",
 "review": "Drafted by Claude, to be corrected by Mohamed Ghoneim. Financial terms follow CBE's own Arabic usage on cbe.org.eg where it was checkable.",

